    "name": "market-research",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "title": "Market Research Notes",
    "description": "Organise market research around the questions it must answer, with sources, findings and a review log, plus automations that start new findings as drafts, log every finding status change and ask for review when a finding is ready.",
